# rz_pi128_ct — R_z(π/128) Clifford+T 근사회로(honest h/t 시퀀스, 엔트리 ℤ[ω]/√2^m 정확). 봉인=회로 unitary EXACT; 목표 대비 ε 는 APPROX-GUARANTEES sidecar(관측·인증 분리). §2 부분해제: 신규 module 0.
```json id=app_meta
{"id": "rz_pi128_ct", "n_sys": 1, "n_anc": 0}
```
```python id=app_golden
import numpy as np
H = np.array([[1,1],[1,-1]],dtype=complex)/np.sqrt(2)
T = np.diag([1, np.exp(1j*np.pi/4)]).astype(complex)
seq = 'TTTTTTTHTHTTHTTHTTHTTHTTHTTHTTHTTHTHTTHTTHTTHT'
U = np.eye(2,dtype=complex)
for g in seq:
    U = (H if g=='H' else T) @ U
golden = U
```
